option.CLOUD_RENDER_DISTANCE=Cloud Render Distance
option.CLOUD_RENDER_DISTANCE.comment=Horizontal cloud range in blocks, limited to the terrain LOD range. Distant clouds fade smoothly; high clouds directly overhead remain visible.
