option.SKY_CLIMATE.comment=Cold, dry, humid and coastal climates gently change atmospheric haze and volumetric cloud balance. Biome crossings ease over time.
option.SKY_VARIATION=Vivid Sunset Events
option.SKY_VARIATION.comment=Occasional clear evenings develop rose and violet afterglow. Lower values keep sunsets closer to their ordinary gold and peach palette.
